    "President Prabowo Subianto officially opened the 114th Muhammadiyah anniversary celebration and Tanwir session in Palu.",
    "Muhammadiyah leadership expressed support for presidential initiatives regarding the improved management of national natural resources.",
    "The organization emphasized concerns regarding economic oligarchy while calling for strengthened national unity and social justice."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Muhammadiyah organization held its 114th anniversary and Tanwir session in Palu, attended by President Prabowo Subianto and government officials including the Minister of Home Affairs. During the proceedings, the General Chairman of the Muhammadiyah Central Executive, Haedar Nashir, addressed the current national climate by highlighting the necessity of maintaining unity amidst evolving political and economic challenges. A central theme of the discussions involved economic equity, with Muhammadiyah leadership cautioning against the risks posed by economic oligarchy to societal fairness. Simultaneously, the organization expressed official support for President Prabowo's ongoing efforts to reform the management of Indonesia's natural resources. Beyond policy matters, the gathering served as a forum for high-level engagement between religious leadership and the national government, including discussions on leadership criteria for future governance roles within the existing administration framework.",
